window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The son of an assassin is in need of protection...</b></p> <p>Moon Jae-young can read minds, and most of the time, it’s a very useful skill. But when he’s assigned to protect the son of an assassin, it becomes something short of torture because Caleb’s thoughts run hot and dangerous.</p> <p>When his assassin family is attacked, razorback shifter and bar owner Caleb Brammer narrowly escapes. His mother calls in a favor to ensure that he is protected. Now he’s stuck with a bodyguard who is all sharp words and cold glares. The only thing they can agree on is finding the killer before they strike again.</p> <p>Unable to resist, Jae-young gives in to Caleb’s flirting and the heat between them. The need to find the killer becomes more pressing because Caleb is his fated mate.</p>"; 
